  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "In the store",
   "texto": [
    "The dependent will tell you **Posso ajudar?** (can I help?).",
    "You ask: **Queria ver aquele casaco** (I wanted to see that jacket).",
    "**Que tamanho?** = what size? The size is **o tamanho**: o tamanho M.",
    "**Posso experimentar?** = Can I try it on? They'll send you to **os provadores** (the testers)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "How it is and how much it costs",
   "texto": [
    "**Fica-me bem** = fits me well. **Fica-lhe bem** = fits you well (you).",
    "**É caro** (is expensive), **é barato** (is cheap). **Tem um tamanho maior?** = does it have a larger size?",
    "**Levo** = I'll take it."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Pay",
   "texto": [
    "**Posso pagar com cartão?** = Can I pay by card?",
    "**Em dinheiro** = in cash. **Dinheiro** is «money».",
    "**Claro** = clear, of course."
   ]
